testing where it's hottest.

00:40:29.900 --> 00:40:32.060
So if there is a really
significant difference

00:40:32.060 --> 00:40:34.820
between right above the--

00:40:34.820 --> 00:40:36.980
right above the
channel and here, then

00:40:36.980 --> 00:40:39.530
we know that this is a
safer area or a better area

00:40:39.530 --> 00:40:40.910
