00:41:24.000 --> 00:41:26.990
You're not going to measure
any heat of that emissions

00:41:26.990 --> 00:41:29.150
of the metals can be so
low for the absorbance

00:41:29.150 --> 00:41:33.380
of the [INAUDIBLE] is going to
be so low so when you see you

00:41:33.380 --> 00:41:37.700
smoke coming out of it, do you--

00:41:37.700 --> 00:41:41.170
so smoke is coming out of the
channels at the bottom, right?

00:41:41.170 --> 00:41:42.770
So is that happening
the entire time,

00:41:42.770 --> 00:41:45.050
or only after you seal the top?

00:41:45.050 --> 00:41:46.467
CURT: Only after
you seal the top.

00:41:46.467 --> 00:41:48.758
AUDIENCE: Is there any reason
you can't seal the bottom

00:41:48.758 --> 00:41:49.970
and then seal the top.

00:41:49.970 --> 00:41:52.270
