00:41:52.270 --> 00:41:54.020
there's actually fire
coming out of it.

00:41:54.020 --> 00:41:56.090
And if the wind changes
direction really quickly

00:41:56.090 --> 00:41:57.940
and if you're standing
close to the barrel,

00:41:57.940 --> 00:41:59.940
you could actually be
pretty close to the flame.

00:41:59.940 --> 00:42:04.040
So the way it's--

00:42:04.040 --> 00:42:06.830
the way the barrel is sealed
now is with the top first

00:42:06.830 --> 00:42:09.000
and then kicking out
the bricks afterwards.

00:42:09.000 --> 00:42:11.144
So we've just stuck with that.

00:42:11.144 --> 00:42:12.440
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE].

00:42:15.830 --> 00:42:19.963
But you don't want this thing
going, wiggling back and forth

00:42:19.963 --> 00:42:22.130
