something like that.

00:42:23.797 --> 00:42:26.890
But if you're not wiggling
the barrel, maybe you

00:42:26.890 --> 00:42:30.470
can just seal the bottom first
and smoke won't billowing out

00:42:30.470 --> 00:42:33.110
of the bottom, and then
you can seal the top.

00:42:33.110 --> 00:42:36.860
