wire to strap in tin foil

00:43:53.820 --> 00:43:56.390
to one third of barrel
or half the barrel.

00:43:56.390 --> 00:43:58.693
And that will act as a
huge radiation shield.

00:43:58.693 --> 00:44:00.110
So if you want to,
that would just

00:44:00.110 --> 00:44:03.830
tell if the heat is coming from
hot air coming from the bottom

00:44:03.830 --> 00:44:06.560
or from radiation
off the barrel.

00:44:06.560 --> 00:44:10.940
And then you would know
actually what your problem is.

00:44:10.940 --> 00:44:12.642
